  "description": "Supply-and-demand market engine — the learner shifts demand/supply curve intercepts and sets a price to see surplus or shortage emerge against the computed equilibrium, on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
